{"id":"en_sorry-pays-well","title":"Sorry Pays Well","titleEn":"Sorry Pays Well","description":"He was humiliated by the woman he loved and the wealthy rival she picked over him. Then a system powered by regret began converting every insult into money. In a single night, he burned through millions, brought gold-diggers to their knees, won back what had been taken, and left everyone who had dismissed him stunned. The same people now plead for his forgiveness, yet he refuses to glance back.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/848b1cb927d85539/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/848b1cb927d85539/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comeback","System","Comeback","System","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_sorry-pays-well_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sorry-pays-well_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sorry-pays-well_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sorry-pays-well_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp42/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sorry-pays-well_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjp